<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1,881 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1,881 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.881 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.880 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    December 3	   December 2</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.881		  1.880</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $5,32 million	    $7,39 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
